# =============================================================
# Files that stay in Git but are never uploaded to Vercel.
# Anything listed here is neither deployed nor served.
#
# Why this file exists: the four AI Hook originals below (~69 MB)
# are masters the site never loads (it plays the compressed copies
# in assets/videos/web/). Leaving them out makes every deploy
# faster and keeps `vercel` CLI uploads under Hobby's 100 MB cap
# (the repo tracks ~133 MB; Git deploys aren't held to that cap).
# =============================================================

# Original video masters (the site uses assets/videos/web/*)
assets/videos/AI Hook Tenda WiFi router.mp4
assets/videos/AI Hook Hair illusion kit.mp4
assets/videos/AI Hook RedBlue light Therapy cap.mp4
assets/videos/AI Hook Ceelike purple mouthwash.mp4

